              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.2.1+ZEC.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zech 2.1–2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was then given a stick that looked like a measuring rod, and was told, “Go and measure the temple of God and the altar, and count those who are worshipping in the temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 21.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But do not measure the outer courts, because they have been given to the heathen, who will trample on the Holy City for 42 months. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send my two witnesses dressed in sackcloth, and they will proclaim God's message during those 1,260 days.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
