            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6+REV.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 13.5–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they finish proclaiming their message, the beast that comes up out of the abyss will fight against them. He will defeat them and kill them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.9+ISA.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 1.9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and their bodies will lie in the street of the great city, where their Lord was crucified. The symbolic name of that city is Sodom, or Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "People from all nations, tribes, languages, and races will look at their bodies for three and a half days and will not allow them to be buried. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of the earth will be happy because of the death of these two. They will celebrate and send presents to each other, because those two prophets brought much suffering upon the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 37.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After three and a half days a life-giving breath came from God and entered them, and they stood up; and all who saw them were terrified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kgs 2.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the two prophets heard a loud voice say to them from heaven, “Come up here!” As their enemies watched, they went up into heaven in a cloud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 6.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that very moment there was a violent earthquake; a tenth of the city was destroyed, and 7,000 people were killed. The rest of the people were terrified and praised the greatness of the God of heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
